              <span style="font-size:10.5px; color:#5f7a72;">Real forced liquidations — nothing simulated. Heatmap: {{ lvCoinName }} events bucketed by price (red = longs liquidated, green = shorts). Tape: live across 24 top perps on Bybit (+ Binance when it delivers). Density builds the longer the dashboard stays open.</span>
